{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24742","headline":"除夜言怀兼赠张常侍 · 白居易","name":"除夜言怀兼赠张常侍","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三百六旬今夜尽，六十四年明日催。\n不用叹身随日老，亦须知寿逐年来。\n加添雪兴凭毡帐，消杀春愁付酒杯。\n唯恨诗成君去後，红笺纸卷爲谁开。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24742.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24742","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}